# MCP Server - Search

## Correr local
1. python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
2. pip install -r requirements.txt
3. cp .env.example .env (o edita .env con tus valores)
4. uvicorn app:app --reload

## Endpoints MCP
- POST /resources/list
- POST /resources/query
- POST /tools/list
- POST /tools/call
- GET  /health
